   "text": "bits of the actual picture?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.55,
   "block": "movies.dlg8",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly, sometimes people at the edges of the frame just vanish. Most film fans keep the bars.",
